{"id": "t028-001", "text": "Farah's birthday is May 14. She's gone really into pottery lately, wants her own wheel eventually but that's a lot. Maybe a class voucher?", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "May 14", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "pottery", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wants her own wheel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "class voucher", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t028-004", "text": "so I was talking to Camila after rehearsal and um her little brother Tomás has his first piano recital on june 3rd and she says he's absolutely terrified so I should send him a good luck card or something", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Camila", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after rehearsal"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "little brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first piano recital", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "june 3rd", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send him a good luck card", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t028-006", "text": "Ellie rang - her dog Biscuit had his op today, all went fine apparently, the vet said he can come home tomorrow afternoon if he eats. she was in bits this morning though, had been up since 5 worrying. Her partner's away in Leeds for work all week so she's on her own with him and the kids", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ellie", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Biscuit", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "op", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "vet", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "come home", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow afternoon", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "since 5"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away in Leeds for work", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "all week", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t028-010", "text": "ok voice note. Lachlan's band is playing the Fleece on Friday the 17th, doors at 8. Him and his girlfriend Sinead are both in it now apparently, she's on bass. don't forget to get tickets before they sell out, he said the last one did", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lachlan", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playing the Fleece", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday the 17th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "8", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Sinead", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "on bass", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "get tickets", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before they sell out", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t028-011", "text": "Zeynep's trip to Japan is off, her mum's not well enough to be left. She'd been planning it since 2023, cherry blossom season, the whole thing, ryokan booked in Kyoto. Feel awful for her. She said maybe autumn 2027 instead if things settle. Her brother is helping out at weekends at least", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "not well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "since 2023"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "cherry blossom season"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "autumn 2027"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "brother", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "weekends"}]}
{"id": "t028-014", "text": "Joanna Fischer (Jo) - new on the team, from Hamburg originally, does triathlons. Seems lovely", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joanna Fischer", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jo", "pronoun": "unknown", "same_as": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "on the team", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "from Hamburg", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "triathlons", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t028-018", "text": "Oscar's play opens Oct 30 and runs till Nov 8th. He's playing Malvolio. Says the dress rehearsal was a disaster but that's tradition right", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "play", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 30", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "till Nov 8th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "playing Malvolio", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dress rehearsal", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t028-022", "text": "Aurelio and Francesca's wedding anniversary is on the 4/12, 10 years. They're going back to Sorrento where they got married", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Francesca", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "wedding anniversary", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "anniversary", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 4/12", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "10 years", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going back to Sorrento", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}]}
{"id": "t028-023", "text": "Kevin's mum Mrs Morris is having her knee done on the 21st. He's taking a week off to look after her", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Kevin", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "mum", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Mrs Morris", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "having her knee done", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 21st", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "taking a week off", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "check_in"}]}
{"id": "t028-024", "text": "Note to self: Ann likes gin, the pink stuff, and anything with flamingos on it. Christmas ideas", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ann", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "gin, the pink stuff", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "flamingos", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t028-029", "text": "chat with Lucy's mum at the school gate. Lucy's grandad passed away last week, funeral's on Monday. I'll take round a lasagne Sunday", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "grandad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "passed away", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "funeral", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "loss", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday"}]}
{"id": "t028-033", "text": "Aditi and her partner are doing a month in Peru next spring, flights booked for March 2027, Machu Picchu trek in week two. She's never done altitude so slightly worried", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "partner", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "month in Peru", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next spring", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "March 2027", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Machu Picchu trek", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in week two", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "slightly worried", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t028-039", "text": "Barbara is into birdwatching now?? Got a pair of binoculars for her bday and has been out every morning since", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "birdwatching", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "pair of binoculars", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "bday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "every morning since", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t028-041", "text": "Farah's sister Zeynep is moving to Melbourne for good in February. Farah is gutted but trying to be positive about it", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "sister", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Melbourne", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in February", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Farah", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "gutted", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "trying to be positive", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t028-043", "text": "Spoke to Oscar on the phone for ages. His girlfriend Chiara is running the Valencia marathon on December 6th and he's going out with her, flying the Thursday before. He's also bought her a fancy GPS watch for the race but hasn't given it yet. Then they're staying on in Spain till the 14th. Remind me to ask him how she did when they get back", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "girlfriend", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chiara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Valencia marathon", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "December 6th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the Thursday before", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "staying on in Spain", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "till the 14th", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how she did", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e3", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "when they get back", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t028-048", "text": "Tomás starts his new job at the airport on Monday. Night shifts, he's not thrilled. ask him how the first week went", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Tomás", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the airport", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "Night shifts", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not thrilled", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "ask him how the first week went", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "ask_outcome", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the first week", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t028-051", "text": "So we went out for drinks after the match and Aurelio told me his wife Barbara is pregnant again, due early April, and he's also up for promotion in Jan. And he's off to Rome for a week in November to see his parents before it all kicks off. Big year for them", "spans": [{"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "after the match"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aurelio", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "wife", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Barbara", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "pregnant", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "due", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "early April", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "promotion", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in Jan", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "off to Rome", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "a week in November", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "parents", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "before it all kicks off", "anchor": "e4"}]}
{"id": "t028-052", "text": "Alana's dad is in hospital again, chest infection. She's flying back to Dublin tomorrow. I should text her Sunday to see how he is", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in hospital", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "chest infection", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "flying back to Dublin", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tomorrow", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "text her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e2", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t028-054", "text": "Note: Chris's birthday Oct 31 (yes really, halloween). Loves vinyl, mostly old soul. Ask Lucy what he already has", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Chris", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "birthday", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "birthday", "followup": "gift"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Oct 31", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "halloween", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "vinyl", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "old soul", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Ask Lucy what he already has", "owner": "p2", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "pronoun": "unknown"}]}
{"id": "t028-056", "text": "The trip to Croatia is booked: fly out 7/18, back the 28th. Need to sort travel insurance and the cat sitter", "spans": [{"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "trip to Croatia", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "7/18", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 28th", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "sort travel insurance and the cat sitter", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}]}
{"id": "t028-057", "text": "Ming's exhibition opening is next Thursday at 7, she's showing three of her big canvases. I'm bringing flowers. She's so anxious about it, keeps saying nobody will turn up. Her mum and her brother Oscar are coming down from Manchester for it. Don't forget to message her the morning of to say good luck", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ming", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "exhibition opening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Thursday at 7", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "anxious", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Oscar", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming down from Manchester", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "message her", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "on"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the morning of", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t028-060", "text": "lunch w Suzanne Khan - her daughter Lucy just started uni in Glasgow, studying vet med, Suzanne is struggling with the empty nest thing, also she's been getting into wild swimming which is helping. Daughter home for reading week end of Oct. I need to send her that article about the swimming group in Clevedon", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne Khan", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Lucy", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "uni in Glasgow", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "studying vet med", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Suzanne", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling with the empty nest thing", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "wild swimming", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "home for reading week", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "end of Oct", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her that article about the swimming group in Clevedon", "owner": "p1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "unspecified"}]}
